        {
            "heading": "Fealy Films 12 x 12",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Soho is an urban village, shaped and redrawn through time and the extraordinary array of creative and talented people who have made it their home or work canvas.\n \nJoin us at the former Warner Brother Sound Studio at 75 Dean Street, home to the Museum of Soho.\n \nJoin us for a selection of historic films of Soho as well as films created by Fealy Films as part of an ambitious project to help local creators make 12 short films in 12 months.",
                "Speak to one of our volunteers for suggestions as you continue to explore our extraordinary neighbourhood."
            ]
